"aGg" = (
/obj/machinery/space_heater,
/obj/item/paper{
	info = "Whoever finds this, we’ve had to move deeper into the lower sections. The biomass is spreading faster than we anticipated—it’s closing in on the upper levels, and we couldn’t risk staying. We’ve sealed off every section we passed, but it’s not going to hold for long.Before we left, we heard someone in the electrical section. It sounded like they were working on something, but none of us dared to go check. With everything going wrong, I can’t say for sure if it was a survivor or not. We couldn’t take the chance, not with them roaming nearby... They’re twisted forms of our former colleagues, their flesh melded into something unrecognizable. It’s both cruel and a mercy to end them; they’re not the people we knew anymore, just abominations driven by an insatiable hunger.";
	icon_state = "paper_neo_words_crumpled_bloodied"
	},
/turf/simulated/floor/industrial/grey_slates,
/area/iskhod/dungeon/outside/prepper/alpha{
	requires_power = 0
