/obj/effect/floor_decal/industrial_plant,
/obj/item/paper{
	info = "Nathan, listen, the electrical section’s sealed. The systems are still failing, cooling’s on the brink, and the reactor’s starting to destabilize. I’ve set up automatics to handle the power distribution, so Alpha and the rest should stay online for now, but the containment’s slipping. It’s spreading through the conduits, blocking everything. If the main core destabilizes, it's not just this sector that’ll go dark.Wilson, Grant, and the supervisor—they didn’t make it. The proxies hit them while we were working on the backups. It happened too fast—no chance to react. They’re still out there, close to the control room. We’re running out of time.I’ve done what I can, but you need to seal the reactor. The automatics might hold things together for a while, but we can’t rely on that. Lock it down before the whole site collapses. We’re past protocols now.";
	layer = 4;
	icon_state = "paper_neo_words_crumpled_bloodied"
	},
